  "byline": null,
  "publishedAt": null,
  "contentHtml": "<figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!w6Is!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5de5d442-0449-4f37-a82b-7e09457b3074_2756x748.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n<img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!w6Is!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5de5d442-0449-4f37-a82b-7e09457b3074_2756x748.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"395\" data-size=\"normal\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n\n\n</a></figure>\n<p>In this space on Saturdays, I <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/t/roundup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">do a weekly round-up</a> of sorts: Sifting through what I wrote that you might have missed during the week, what I’ve been reading and watching myself, and some other fun things that have been going on.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/subscribe?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h4>📝 What I did this week</h4>\n<p><em>Here are the things I wrote or podcasted about during the previous week, sorted in descending order by quality, popularity and/or current relevance.</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>📊👀 If you haven’t already, <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/t/updating-model\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">check out my many trackers</a> for football season: </p>\n<ul>\n<li><p><strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-nfl-odds-tracker-and-elo-ratings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">📈2026 NFL Odds Tracker and Elo Ratings🏈</a></strong> - This now includes archives of my QB EPA leaderboard (which will be updated for 2026 when games begin) and an experimental way to track <a href=\"http://www.sports-reference.com/blog/approximate-value-methodology/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Approximate Value</a> in-season.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-college-football-odds-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">🎓2026 College Football Odds Tracker and QB Rankings🏈</a> </strong>- The odds are running and I’m <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2024-college-football-quarterback\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">updating the QB ratings</a> I used to use in my wildly unpopular <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/t/qb-u\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“QB U” columns</a>, lol.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-27-english-premier-league-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">⚽ 2026-27 English Premier League Tracker 📈</a></strong> - Soccer also exists!</p></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><p>📺 <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/welcome-to-sports-eternal-present\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Welcome to Sports’ Eternal Present</a></strong> - Old sports broadcasts used to come with obvious visual cues about, you know, <em>when </em>they happened. But the rapid shift to high-definition TV flattened decades of sports history into an endless “now”, where old highlights and current-day action increasingly blur together in the same context-free content feed.</p></li>\n<li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/arte-morenos-angels-ownership-should\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Arte Moreno’s Angels Ownership Should Have Been a Golden Era. What Went Wrong?</a></strong> - With Stan Kroenke set to buy a controlling share of the Halos at a $4 billion valuation, Arte Moreno’s tenure is finally ending. What was its legacy? Well, after more than two decades of big payrolls and generational stars, L.A. still has almost nothing to show for that time, except MLB’s longest active playoff drought.</p></li>\n<li><p>🏈 <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/the-chiefs-are-going-to-be-nfl-main\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Chiefs Are Going To Be NFL Main Characters Again, Aren’t They?</a></strong> - Sorry, Chiefs haters: After a disastrous 6-win 2025 season wrecked by a record-setting swing in bad luck and capped by Patrick Mahomes’ ACL injury, Kansas City’s underlying numbers suggest they are primed to regress right back into the championship picture in 2026.</p></li>\n<li><p>🏈 <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/why-regression-to-the-mean-may-be\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Why Regression to the Mean May Be the Cowboys’ Secret Weapon</a></strong> - Speaking of regression… Dallas stumbled to 7-9-1 in 2025 with one of the NFL’s best passing attacks and arguably its worst modern defense — an absurdly lopsided combination that, ironically, may actually make a 2026 rebound much easier to engineer than it looks.</p></li>\n<li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/enjoy-baseballs-september-of-uncertainty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Enjoy Baseball’s September of Uncertainty While It Lasts</a></strong> -  Entering September, 16 MLB teams were still within two games of a playoff spot, setting up a chaotic final month of the regular season. But even after the standings finally sort themselves out, bigger questions loom over baseball — so we should enjoy September’s messiness while we can.</p></li>\n<li>\n<p><span>🏁 </span><strong><a href=\"https://www.nascar.com/news-media/2026/09/03/the-chase-is-built-for-denny-hamlin-but-can-he-finally-finish-the-job/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Chase is built for Denny Hamlin, but can he finally finish the job?</a></strong><span> - Ahead of NASCAR’s Chase playoffs (presented by Mobil 1) starting this weekend, I ran a revamped version of </span><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-nascar-cup-series-driver-rankings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>my Cup Series forecast projection system</span></a><span>, with 10,000 simulations tracking each driver’s chance to win the title — and explained why the particulars of </span><a href=\"https://www.racing-reference.info/season-stats/2026/W/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>this year’s Chase schedule</span></a><span> make Hamlin a big-time favorite:</span></p>\n<div class=\"reader-datawrapper\"><a href=\"https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/bnnJa/3/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/73b1ca58-da4b-4ef5-99a9-b4fdc697f7ee_1220x932.png\" alt=\"How the Chase schedule differs from the overall 2026 Cup schedule\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><p>How the Chase schedule differs from the overall 2026 Cup schedule</p></div>\n<ul><li><p>🏁🎙️ <strong><a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/episode/5ZG7HKe0EuB7pPdxyWwT61?si=M7fI9I9wQc-fe5r0ItRZAQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Podracing: Preece’s Pieces</a></strong> - In this week’s , <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/tyler-lauletta-b0399667/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Lauletta</a> and I celebrated Ryan Preece’s walk-off win at Daytona — I thought those were supposed to be a thing of the past! — even if it did come at the expense of Podcast Patron Saint SVG. Then we talk about The Chase (presented by Mobil 1), and why my model might be too high — or not? — on Denny’s chances. Finally, we look to Darlington for the chaos to begin, and <em>finally </em>we get to reset our slate of one-and-done drivers to choose from.</p></li></ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>📊 Charts of the week:</h4>\n<p>Here were my favorite items of the week from <em><strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/scoreboard-newsletter-archives\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Scoreboard</a></strong></em>, my daily newsletter for <a href=\"https://sherwood.news/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Sherwood News</a>… </p>\n<p><strong>🏀</strong><em><strong> On Team USA’s <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/the-pros-are-back-in-town\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">pre-tourney chances at the FIBA worlds</a>…</strong></em></p>\n<div></div>\n<p><strong>🎾</strong><em><strong> On the U.S. Open’s <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/do-the-crime-do-the-time\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">oldest winners</a>…</strong></em></p>\n<p>⚽<strong> </strong><em><strong>On soccer’s <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/money-talks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">summer spending spree</a>…</strong></em></p>\n<div class=\"reader-datawrapper\"><a href=\"https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/g374D/1/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/1f389ed5-71ff-4e1f-b253-e848a43960ec_1220x2476.png\" alt=\"Many of the largest transfers ever just happened\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><p>Many of the largest transfers ever just happened</p></div>\n<p>🏆<strong> </strong><em><strong>On Stan Kroenke’s <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/money-talks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">history of winning titles</a>…</strong></em></p>\n<p><strong>⚾</strong><em><strong> On the Cubs’ <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/cubs-launch-messi-leaves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">month of dingers</a>…</strong></em></p>\n<div class=\"reader-datawrapper\"><a href=\"https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/bSFJg/1/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/4de1d5d9-f40f-40e3-b0a1-9e628f10191c_1220x1108.png\" alt=\"The Cubs had a historically homer-happy August\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><p>The Cubs had a historically homer-happy August</p></div>\n<p><em>Subscribe to <strong>Scoreboard</strong> by <strong><a href=\"https://join.sherwood.news/scoreboard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">clicking here</a></strong>!</em></p>\n<h4>👀 Some interesting things I read/watched this week</h4>\n<p><em>A collection of articles (with a heavy focus on my fellow Substackers), videos and other media that I enjoyed and/or found thought-provoking over the past week. I don’t always 100% agree with or endorse what’s linked here… but that’s also sort of the point.</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><p><strong><span>🎾 </span><a href=\"https://www.benrothenberg.com/p/us-open-tennis-scores-scorigami-tracker-lev-akabas-interview?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1174649&amp;post_id=213628384&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“Keeping Unique Scores in Tennis”</span></a></strong><span> by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><strong>⚾ <a href=\"https://downonthefarm.substack.com/p/the-mid-season-promotions-most-likely?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=848963&amp;post_id=213991618&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“The Mid-Season Promotions Most Likely to Make a Difference Down the Stretch”</a></strong> by  </p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>⚾ </span><a href=\"https://ritmica1.substack.com/p/want-a-cy-young-dont-be-a-phillie?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=5688290&amp;post_id=213959057&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“Want a Cy Young? Don’t Be a Phillie, Silly”</span></a></strong><span> by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><span>⚾ </span><strong><a href=\"https://almostcooperstown.substack.com/p/war-says-pca-wpa-says-yordan-alvarez?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1216321&amp;post_id=213715577&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=false&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“WAR Says PCA. WPA Says Yordan Alvarez. Who’s Right?”</a></strong><span> and </span><strong><a href=\"https://almostcooperstown.substack.com/p/manny-machado-nolan-arenado-and-jose?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1216321&amp;post_id=214027585&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=false&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“Manny Machado, Nolan Arenado, &amp; José Ramírez: Measuring Up to Scott Rolen”</span></a></strong><span> by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><span>⚾</span><strong><a href=\"https://www.bravestoday.com/p/why-are-the-braves-so-much-better?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=2943888&amp;post_id=214093963&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“Why Are the Braves So Much Better at Home?”</span></a></strong><span> by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><span>⚾ </span><strong><a href=\"https://baseballspast.substack.com/p/why-60-feet-six-inches?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=6364294&amp;post_id=214099628&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“Why 60 Feet, Six Inches?”</span></a></strong><span> by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>⚾ </span><a href=\"https://edwithsports.substack.com/p/how-important-is-height-to-first?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=2391764&amp;post_id=213812767&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“How Important is Height to First Basemen?”</span></a></strong><span>by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><span>⚾</span><strong><a href=\"https://ibwaa.substack.com/p/did-you-hug-your-opponent-tonight?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=96452&amp;post_id=213740871&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span> “Did You Hug Your Opponent Tonight?”</span></a></strong><span> by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>⚾ </span><a href=\"https://downtoblack.substack.com/p/torontos-most-valuable-position-player?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1724907&amp;post_id=213676839&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“Toronto’s Most Valuable Position Player”</span></a></strong><span>by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>⚾</span><a href=\"https://www.warningtrackpwr.com/p/changeup?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=242726&amp;post_id=212897033&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span> “The 379-Foot Journey of the 98 MPH Changeup” </span></a></strong><span>by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><span>⚾ </span><strong><a href=\"https://uniwatch.substack.com/p/a-close-look-at-mlb-coaches-uniform?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=10041743&amp;post_id=212996861&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“A Close Look at MLB Coaches’ Uniform Numbers”</span></a></strong><span> by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><strong>🏀 <a href=\"https://www.theringer.com/2026/09/02/nba/nba-changes-rules-salary-cap-draft-3-pointers-dunks-adam-silver\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“22 Increasingly Unhinged Ways to Fix the NBA”</a></strong> by The Ringer</p></li>\n<li>\n<p><strong><span>🏀 </span><a href=\"https://www.pablo.show/p/it-happened?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1473236&amp;post_id=213992876&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“It Happened. EPISODE 423: The biggest punishment in NBA history.”</span></a></strong><span>by </span> </p>\n<ul><li>\n<p>Incidentally, <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/the-nba-is-lucky-the-kawhi-leonard?utm_source=publication-search\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">read my take here</a> on why the Kawhi scandal was surprisingly <strong>insignificant</strong>, in the sense that the Clippers’ cheating didn’t actually affect NBA history at all (because <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/when-it-comes-to-playoff-disappointment?utm_source=publication-search\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">they’re the Clippers</a>):<br></p>\n\n</li></ul>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>🏀 <a href=\"https://www.rightstorickysanchez.com/p/we-will-get-frustrated-with-jaylen?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=2289770&amp;post_id=214161045&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“We Will Get Frustrated With Jaylen Brown”</a></strong> by  </p></li>\n<li><p><strong>🏀 <a href=\"https://chartinghoops.substack.com/p/mailbag-no-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“Mailbag No. 1” Basketball Roles, Australia, Very Average Players, and More!”</a></strong> by  <em>(<strong>Note: </strong>I always keep forgetting to put Chris’ stuff in these round-ups, and that is a mistake! <strong><a href=\"https://chartinghoops.substack.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">You should subscribe to him</a></strong> if you haven’t already!)</em></p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>🏀 </span><a href=\"https://bellottibasketball.substack.com/p/wnba-gravity-scores-what